WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.595
The lasting message: express a network's power as
which equivariant graph polynomials it can compute.

00:00:06.675 --> 00:00:10.693
Each is a small multi-graph evaluated by a tensor
contraction,

00:00:10.773 --> 00:00:15.781
a finer ruler than Weisfeiler-Lehman and a direct
list of missing operations.

00:00:15.861 --> 00:00:17.103
Acting on that list,

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:23.117
precomputed polynomial features push ordinary graph
networks past three-WL to best-in-class

00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:25.100
molecular property prediction.
